From: Zach Taylor <zctaylor.work@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 20 May 2026 22:48:46 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] Add in-process gRPC agent bridge (oh-my-warp)

Phase 1: a passthrough AIClient decorator (app/src/server/server_api/ai/bridge.rs)
injected at ServerApi::get_ai_client(), gated on a backend with a grpc_endpoint
(new field on agent_backends::Backend). Forwards all 46 trait methods to the real
client today; Phase 2 will override the agent control ops to call the gRPC harness
host, Phase 3 bridges the event stream. No behavior change unless a gRPC backend
is selected.
